  "description": "Follow-up from TASK-1.17 (judge J-2-01). The locked e2e test e2e/cards.spec.ts:215 'logo check fails when the logo is hidden or does not load' is flaky on WebKit in CI: 2 of 3 attempts on doit/TASK-1.17 (runs 44892551075, 44893582074 attempt 1) reported ['missing'] instead of ['not decoded'] for the broken-image mutant; it passed 20/20 locally and on main CI #125. 'missing' means logoProblems found no image[data-part=\"logo\"] element at all, so the mutation/check likely races the gallery render (openCardGallery waits for any card-back image, then page.evaluate's setAttribute uses ?. and silently no-ops). The user asked for it to be fixed (2026-11-21). Owners of the locked file: TASK-3.5, TASK-3.20, TASK-3.23 \u2014 strengthen-only edits.",
